notes.body:
Thanks a lot for the comments. I think I addressed everything in the latest patch set. Still want to improve the commit message and of course the Debian package doesn't build.

@eapache1 That's a good point about `in_scope`, I removed it from wmem,

@AndersBroman I removed the `wmem_scopes.h` rename.

